ssion of a bailee and are to be deliv- ered without being moved (a) tender requires that the seller either tender a negotiable docu- ment of title covering such goods or procure acknowledgment by the bailee of the buyer’s right to possession of the goods; but § 2–502 UNIFORM COMMERCIAL CODE"